    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# #05-RAG-Core v1.0 (2026-05-25)\n\n共用 RAG 檢索核心子工作流。被 4 支查詢入口(非串流×雲地 / 串流×雲地)用 Execute Workflow 呼叫。\n\n## 契約\n- 輸入(呼叫端傳):{ chatInput, app_name, collection_name, sessionId, min_keywords }\n- 內部:Fetch Config(app_name→collection 單一來源)→ Fetch KW → Build Context → Agent1 Intent(雲端,同 #05 現況)→ Route → RAG(embed→qdrant→fallback→context→LLM input)或 Direct\n- 輸出:\n  - route='rag': { user_content, system_prompt, model, context, hits, sources, keywords_used, sessionId, ai_provider, cloud_ai_url/key, ollama_url/key }\n  - route='direct': { answer, sessionId, ai_provider }\n\n## 版本歷史\n- v1.0 (2026-05-25): 從 #05-Query-v1.10 抽出檢索段(Build LLM Input 之前)。intent 暫維持雲端 langchain Agent1+Memory(零行為變更);純地端 intent 切換留作後續。\n\n## 設計理由\n檢索回傳離散結果(非串流),放子工作流不違反「串流不可用子工作流」規則 → 4 支入口共用一份檢索,只差最後 LLM 呼叫。\n\n--- v1.0.2 2026-05-30: Code -> Set (Build Callback x5 + Build Exclude Request + Build RAG Context, native expressions with .reduce/.map/.filter)\n--- v1.0.3 2026-05-30: Deploy-ready cleanup (strip readonly fields, dedupe node names, redirect Sub-Chat-Local→Cloud, sentinel for deploy_n8n.py id-rewire)\n\n--- v1.0.6 2026-05-31: [SUPERSEDED — sticky 宣稱已移除但實作未動;見 v1.0.15] Removed hardcoded URL fallbacks (docling/qdrant/ollama/backend).\n\n--- v1.0.15 2026-05-31: 真正移除 hardcoded fallback。v1.0.6 sticky 過度宣稱,當時 Fetch Backend Config / Fetch L1L2L3 / Build Context Vars 還有 `|| 'http://tigerai-backend:3060'`, `|| 'http://qdrant-tigerai:6333'`, `|| 'http://ollama:11434'`。現在:backend_url 由 caller (#05-NonStream-Cloud-v1.0) / (#05b-Cloud-Streaming-Generic-v2.0) 的 Prep Core Input 從 webhook body 傳入;qdrant_url/ollama_url 由 /query/config 回應提供。全部缺欄時 `throw new Error(...)` fail loud。\n",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
